# Composite type annotation: function type via [Fn@ReturnType [ParamType]] syntax.
# A higher-order function annotated to accept Fn(Int -> Number).
# The composite annotation [type: [Fn@Number [Int]] default: [fn [let x] 0]] resolves
# the parameter type to Function(Int -> Number) via resolve_type_expr_value.
[apply: [fn [let f@[type: [Fn@Number [Int]] default: [fn [let _] 0]]] [f 1]]
 result: [apply [fn [let _] 2]]]
=== out
["apply": [fn [let f] ...]  "result": 2]
